16 0 obj
<< /A 37 0 R /Alt (Scatter plot of genome sizes for six plant species: Arabidopsis thaliana, Gossypium hirsutum, Nicotiana benthamiana, Oryza sativa ssp. Japonica, Pisum sativum, and Sorghum bicolor. Each species is represented by different colors and symbols, indicating measurement methods: Feulgen microdensitometry, flow cytometry, K-mer analysis, spectrophotometry, and whole genome sequencing. Data points exhibit variations in genome sizes, depicted on separate panels for each species, with error bars indicating variability.) /K 1 /P 8 0 R /Pg 29 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
